name: xdzip
title: XDZip
version: '@VERSION@'
summary: Browse, create, and extract archives
description: |
  XDZip is an open-source archive manager. Browse ZIP, 7z, RAR, TAR and other
  archives, search their contents, preview supported files, and extract selected
  entries to a folder you choose. Create archives and work with supported
  password-protected and split formats. XDZip processes archives locally.
license: Apache-2.0
base: core24
architectures: [amd64]
grade: @GRADE@
confinement: strict
apps:
  xdzip:
    command: bin/launch
    plugs: [desktop, desktop-legacy, wayland, x11, home]
